<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cameron Ashley cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cameron Ashley cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robinson-Humphrey said it cut the rating on Cameron Ashley Building Products Inc to near-term market perform from buy, and kept the long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1-3/8 to 12-1/4.</p>
<p>-- reduced earnings estimates to $1.52 per share from $1.58 for 1997, ending in October, and to $1.75 from $1.80 for 1998.</p>
</text>
